    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '<b>01 / Friend 1</b>


    Avoids eye contact when nervous.

    Never
    makes big claims.


    ---------------------------------------------------


    <b>02
    / Friend 2</b>


    Always overconfident. Watches me when she thinks I''m distracted.


    ---------------------------------------------------


    <b>03
    / Friend 3</b>


    Smiles when she lies. Or maybe I''m imagining that.


    ---------------------------------------------------

'
